Many non-adjacent inserts in a large known region overflow the wire buffer
mid-undo, triggering raspflush.
args: -R input

-- script --
startfile 0
type ,x/X/ a/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA/\n
exit
